{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-sr-psz-naming-critique","title":"裴松之讥孙休造无说之字制不典之音","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-6131fbe3eb08325fbc34","label":"裴松之按语","text":"臣松之引《传》名以制义义以出礼，讥休造无（况）〔说〕之字、制不典之音，违明诰垂嗤呆，坟土未干而妻子夷灭，师服之言于是乎征","evidence":["santizhu-q-d2c615f9592535caba72"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0003","role":"讥评孙休制名","evidence":["santizhu-q-d2c615f9592535caba72"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu-q-d2c615f9592535caba72"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-d2c615f9592535caba72","source_order":[48,267,0],"order":8630}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0003","name":"裴松之","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-d2c615f9592535caba72","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-341eb2a2a73b661e1ca4","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：《传》称“名以制义，义以出礼；礼以体政，政以正民。是以政成而民听，易则生乱”。斯言之作，岂虚也哉！休欲令难犯，何患无名？而乃造无（况）〔说〕之字，制不典之音；违明诰于前修，垂嗤呆于后代：不亦异乎！是以坟土未干，而妻子夷灭。师服之言，于是乎征矣。","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-072da413c00efbbe9696","start":281,"end":409,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
